// VALIDATION RULES
// 1. Every player must have a name, pos, team, league, era, ovr, and source.
// 2. ovr must be 0-99. pac/sho/pas/dri/def/phy must be 0-99.
// 2. pos must be one of the position codes (GK, RB, LB, CB1, CB2, CDM, CM, CAM, RW, LW, ST, plus depth codes).
// 3. team must be one of the official team names from the LEAGUES list.
// 3. league must be one of the historical/current leagues.
// 4. era must be a decade string (e.g., "1950s", "1980s", "2000s", "2010s", "2020s").
// 4. xf is optional (null or omitted if no X-factor).
// 5. source must explain how the rating was derived (source name, method, confidence).
// 5. No duplicate players (same name + team + era).
// 6. Position balance: aim for ~20 players per position across all eras.
// 6. Total players: ~1,500-2,000 (current players with era adjustment + historical greats).